# Dockerfile.apex only needs this package and its production dependencies.
# Keep legacy experiments, credentials and historical archives out of the
# build context instead of relying on an ever-growing cache directory list.
**
!Dockerfile.apex
!requirements-apex.txt
!apex_bot/
!apex_bot/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.env*
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.csv
**/*.parquet
**/*.pkl
**/*.log
